@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/medbox/api/v1

# ============================================================
# 服药计划与提醒 · 调试脚本
# 前置：先跑 auth.http 的「登录」拿到 token
# 契约详见 medbox-spec/02_服药计划与提醒.md
#   - times 为设备本地墙钟 "HH:mm"，非 UTC，原样收发
#   - items 一次提醒可含多种药；PUT 为整体覆盖
#   - syncState 仅回显，创建后初始恒为 PENDING
# ============================================================

### 创建服药计划（一次提醒含两种药）
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "elderId": "e-1001",
  "name": "早餐后",
  "times": ["08:00", "20:00"],
  "repeatRule": "DAILY",
  "missAlarmAfterMin": 15,
  "alarmRule": { "miss": true, "env": true },
  "items": [
    { "medicineId": "m-205", "dose": "1", "unit": "片" },
    { "medicineId": "m-388", "dose": "2", "unit": "粒", "note": "餐后" }
  ]
}

### 查询老人计划列表（分页，列表项含药品概览）
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans?elderId=e-1001&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 计划详情（含 items 明细）
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/p-3301
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 未来待服药时间线（按次展开，days 默认 7、上限 60）
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/p-3301/next-doses?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 启用 / 停用计划
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/plans/p-3301/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "ENABLED" }

### 修改计划（整体覆盖：times / repeatRule / items 全量提交）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/plans/p-3301
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "elderId": "e-1001",
  "name": "早餐后(改)",
  "times": ["08:00"],
  "repeatRule": "DAILY",
  "missAlarmAfterMin": 15,
  "alarmRule": { "miss": true, "env": false },
  "items": [
    { "medicineId": "m-205", "dose": "1", "unit": "片" }
  ]
}

### 删除计划（级联删除明细）
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/plans/p-3301
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}
